  <result aggregation-status="1" type="3">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The impact pathway depends of the the selected off-take market mechanism design. In the case of army lorries, the project supports a conversation of a large fleet of military vehicle to be converted from heavy diesel to BioCNG. In addition project creates advanced engineering jobs in green energy.</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Large size (2MW biogas) plant&apos;s output can be retrofitted to fuel up to 50 lorries/day. The target investment mobilisation USD10mn would retrofit min. 5 plants and fuel min. 250 army lorries per day.</narrative>
   </description>
